full-screen, the application uses a function to ignore mouse events.  HTML elements still receive mouse events even when the function is active. Therefore, event listeners can be implemented in the renderer to control when mouse events are ignored.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra\\web\\css\\main.css","EndLine":60,"StartLine":1,"toolAction":"Viewing web/css/main.css layout rules","toolSummary":"View main.css layout"}}]}
