{"step_index":2354,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-27T05:27:40Z","thinking":"Working to determine the layout of the UI elements based on the provided screen resolution and available working area, accounting for the taskbar at the bottom. Calculating the dimensions of columns and rows within the working area. Window dimensions for 'Parakeet' are approximately 600x650-700px. Analyzing the potential placement of a 'Spectra' window, considering its specified width and height, and deducing the starting coordinates for its top-left corner within each of the six slots.\n\n\nCalculations confirm the precise x, y coordinates for each window placement slot based on the screen resolution, ensuring accurate positioning.  Now designing the HTML structure, mirroring the visual style elements observed in the existing module to create a visually consistent and functional overlay for window movement. Each slot will handle a click and trigger the selection IPC with its associated location identifier.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Reposition Spectra</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            user-select: none;\n        }\n\n        body, html {\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(3px);\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n            color: #ffffff;\n        }\n\n        .overlay-container {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 16px;\n            padding: 16px;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n        }\n\n        .position-slot {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);\n            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.20);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            position: relative;\n            transition: all 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .position-slot:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);\n            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n            transform: scale(1.008);\n        }\n\n        .position-slot.active {\n            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18);\n            border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.90);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.40);\n        }\n\n        /* Mockup layout matching Parakeet preview inside each slot */\n        .preview-box {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 8px;\n            width: 75%;\n            height: 65%;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            opacity: 0.6;\n            transition: opacity 0.18s ease;\n        }\n\n        .position-slot:hover .preview-box {\n            opacity: 0.95;\n        }\n\n        .preview-header {\n            height: 28px;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 0 10px;\n            gap: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .preview-dot {\n            width: 8px;\n            height: 8px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n        }\n\n        .preview-body {\n            flex: 1;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .slot-title {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 12px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .position-slot.active .slot-title {\n            color: #93c5fd;\n            font-weight: 700;\n        }\n\n        .hint-bar {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 20px;\n            left: 50%;\n            transform: translateX(-50%);\n            background: rgba(15, 17, 26, 0.85);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            padding: 8px 18px;\n            border-radius: 999px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #e2e4ea;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 100;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .hint-kbd {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n            padding: 2px 7px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            font-family: monospace;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"hint-bar\">\n        <span>Click a zone to snap Spectra into position</span>\n        <span class=\"hint-kbd\">ESC</span> to cancel\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"overlay-container\">\n        <!-- Row 1: Top Slots -->\n        <div class=\"position-slot\" data-slot=\"top-left\">\n            <div class=\"preview-box\">\n                <div class=\"preview-header\">\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"preview-body\">Top Left</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"slot-title\">Top Left</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"position-slot\" data-slot=\"top-center\">\n            <div class=\"preview-box\">\n                <div class=\"preview-header\">\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"preview-body\">Top Center</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"slot-title\">Top Center</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"position-slot\" data-slot=\"top-right\">\n            <div class=\"preview-box\">\n                <div class=\"preview-header\">\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"preview-body\">Top Right</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"slot-title\">Top Right</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 2: Bottom Slots -->\n        <div class=\"position-slot\" data-slot=\"bottom-left\">\n            <div class=\"preview-box\">\n                <div class=\"preview-header\">\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"preview-body\">Bottom Left</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"slot-title\">Bottom Left</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"position-slot\" data-slot=\"bottom-center\">\n            <div class=\"preview-box\">\n                <div class=\"preview-header\">\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"preview-body\">Bottom Center</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"slot-title\">Bottom Center</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"position-slot\" data-slot=\"bottom-right\">\n            <div class=\"preview-box\">\n                <div class=\"preview-header\">\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"preview-dot\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"preview-body\">Bottom Right</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"slot-title\">Bottom Right</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n        const activeLocation = urlParams.get('current') || 'top-right';\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.position-slot').forEach(slotEl => {\n            const slotName = slotEl.getAttribute('data-slot');\n            if (slotName === activeLocation) {\n                slotEl.classList.add('active');\n            }\n\n            slotEl.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                if (window.spectraAPI && window.spectraAPI.selectLocation) {\n                    window.spectraAPI.selectLocation(slotName);\n                } else {\n                    console.log('Selected slot:', slotName);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n            if (e.key === 'Escape') {\n                if (window.spectraAPI && window.spectraAPI.closeMoveOverlay) {\n                    window.spectraAPI.closeMoveOverlay();\n                }\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create full-screen 6-slot repositioning overlay matching Parakeet AI 1:1","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra\\web\\move-overlay.html","toolAction":"Writing web/move-overlay.html","toolSummary":"Create move-overlay.html"}}]}
