{"step_index":2376,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-27T05:29:56Z","thinking":"Initial assessment suggests utilizing flexbox for `.brand-header` to manage layout. Applying `justify-content: space-between` and `align-items: center` should properly distribute and vertically center the elements within the header container. This approach provides a structured and responsive design for the header's contents.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add styling for Move button and header actions in web/css/main.css","EndLine":176,"Instruction":"Update .brand-header and add move button styles","ReplacementContent":"/* ===== BRAND HEADER ===== */\n.brand-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);\n    padding-top: var(--space-sm);\n}\n\n.brand-info {\n    text-align: left;\n}\n\n.header-window-actions {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.icon-btn-move, .header-action-btn.move-btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    font-size: var(--font-xs);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n    outline: none;\n}\n\n.icon-btn-move:hover, .header-action-btn.move-btn:hover {\n    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18);\n    border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);\n    color: #60a5fa;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);\n}","StartLine":169,"TargetContent":"/* ===== BRAND HEADER ===== */\n.brand-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);\n    padding-top: var(--space-sm);\n}","TargetFile":"c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra\\web\\css\\mai